  Description: "COMPANION / RARE / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nPaid refreshes cost 2 less gold
    per talent, minimum 1 gold. Applies to both normal and dream-stock refreshes.\r\n\nSUPPORT
    WHILE OWNED\nChampion / Knockback: +4%\nChampion / Movement speed: -1%\nTier
    1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\nPERSONAL
    PASSIVE\nEvery 4s in combat, attempt to heal the hero for 1.35 HP before healing
    modifiers. Healing restrictions apply.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed
    memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly
    stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: hearth,
    resolve. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; three equal-species/equal-star
    bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
